    {
      "text": "Fig. 10, ‘Trend of data volume for key HWF topics in the NHWA data platform by year of data release’. A stacked vertical bar chart showing total data points (vertical axis 0 to 300 000) across annual releases from 2018 to 2025, broken down by nine topics: Stock, Activity level, Sex, Age group, Place of birth, Place of training, Facility ownership, Facility type, and Graduates. Total volume grows nearly 20-fold from 12 587 data points in 2018 (stock data only) to 248 873 data points in 2025 across all nine topics.",
